  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "How did a five-thousand-to-one shot win the Premier League?",
      "scene": {
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "odds",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "odds",
            "pick": "LEICESTER CITY",
            "market": "TO WIN THE PREMIER LEAGUE",
            "to": 5000,
            "foot": "AUGUST 2015",
            "w": 0,
            "y": 1080
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "trophy_lift",
            "big": "?",
            "bigSize": 420,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 7
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In August 2015, the bookmakers made Leicester City five-thousand-to-one to win the title.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "years",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "2015",
                "top": "AUGUST",
                "label": "Before a ball is kicked",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#1d3fa0"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "odds_board",
            "w": 4
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "odds_board",
            "big": "5,000/1",
            "bigSize": 230,
            "bigCol": "#ffd400",
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And fair enough. At Christmas the season before, they were bottom of the league.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "christmas_bottom",
            "label": "CHRISTMAS 2014",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "20TH|OUT OF 20",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 200,
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then they won seven of their last nine games, and survived.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "tally",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "tally",
            "n": 7,
            "cols": 4,
            "mark": "W",
            "markCol": "#1ea85a",
            "title": "7 WINS IN THE LAST 9",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "SURVIVED",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 200,
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, they hired Claudio Ranieri. Greece had just sacked him, after losing to the Faroe Islands.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "ranieri"
            },
            "name": "CLAUDIO RANIERI",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "ranieri"
            },
            "name": "SACKED BY GREECE",
            "stamp": "SACKED",
            "w": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "score",
            "top": "NOVEMBER 2014",
            "home": "GREECE",
            "homeCol": "#0d5eaf",
            "away": "FAROE ISLANDS",
            "awayCol": "#ffffff",
            "score": "0-1",
            "w": 11
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His deal with the players? Keep a clean sheet, and I'll buy you pizza.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "orange",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "RANIERI'S|DEAL",
            "hi": 1,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "CLEAN SHEET|=",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 170,
            "w": 7
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "pizza",
            "big": "PIZZA",
            "bigSize": 220,
            "w": 13
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "They finally kept one in October, and he took them all out for pizza.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "orange",
        "type": "tally",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "tally",
            "n": 1,
            "cols": 1,
            "mark": "0",
            "markCol": "#1ea85a",
            "title": "FIRST CLEAN SHEET",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "pizza",
            "label": "OCTOBER 2015",
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On the pitch, they sat deep, and hit you on the break.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "press",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "press",
            "won": "ON THE BREAK",
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Up front, Jamie Vardy scored in eleven league games in a row.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "vardy"
            },
            "name": "JAMIE VARDY",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "tally",
            "n": 11,
            "cols": 4,
            "icon": "ball",
            "labels": [
              "BOURNEMOUTH",
              "",
              "",
              "",
              "",
              "",
              "",
              "",
              "",
              "",
              "MAN UNITED"
            ],
            "title": "11 IN A ROW",
            "count": true,
            "dy": 40,
            "w": 6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Premier League record.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "vardy_goal",
            "stamp": "RECORD",
            "stampY": 520,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Behind him, N'Golo Kanté made a hundred and seventy-five tackles. More than anyone in the league.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "kante"
            },
            "name": "N'GOLO KANTÉ",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "kante_tackle",
            "w": 4
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 175,
            "word": "TACKLES",
            "size": 400,
            "w": 6
          },
          {
            "type": "heatmap",
            "label": "EVERYWHERE",
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Riyad Mahrez scored seventeen, set up eleven, and was named PFA Player of the Year.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "statbars",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statbars",
            "person": {
              "image": "mahrez"
            },
            "stats": [
              {
                "v": 17,
                "label": "GOALS"
              },
              {
                "v": 11,
                "label": "ASSISTS"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "mahrez_trophy",
            "label": "PFA PLAYER OF THE YEAR",
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, on the second of May, they could win the title without even playing.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "years",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "2016",
                "top": "2 MAY",
                "label": "Title day",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#1d3fa0"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "WITHOUT|PLAYING",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 180,
            "w": 11
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tottenham had to win at Chelsea. It finished two-all.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "chelsea_spurs",
            "label": "CHELSEA v SPURS",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "score",
            "top": "2 MAY 2016",
            "home": "CHELSEA",
            "homeCol": "#034694",
            "away": "TOTTENHAM",
            "awayCol": "#ffffff",
            "score": "2-2",
            "foot": "LEICESTER ARE CHAMPIONS",
            "w": 7
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Leicester players watched it together, at Jamie Vardy's house.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "vardy_party",
            "label": "AT VARDY'S HOUSE",
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Champions. By ten points.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "trophy_lift",
            "big": "CHAMPIONS",
            "bigSize": 170,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "title": "PREMIER LEAGUE 2015/16",
            "rows": [
              {
                "pos": 1,
                "name": "Leicester City",
                "pts": 81,
                "hi": true
              },
              {
                "pos": 2,
                "name": "Arsenal",
                "pts": 71
              },
              {
                "pos": 3,
                "name": "Tottenham",
                "pts": 70
              }
            ],
            "w": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "From five-thousand-to-one.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "leicesterfans",
            "big": "5,000/1",
            "bigSize": 240,
            "bigCol": "#ffd400",
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}